# InsectAI hardware-db workshop feedback TODOs
**Workshop feedback suggestions**
=== General technical ===
- [x] Need to figure out a way to put descriptions under the questions to clarify - was already implemented and I forgot 😅
- [x] DeviceID is confusing for users, but is difficult to generate automatically... We can try and direct users to `data/` dir and ask to check existing deviceIDs, or we need a different solution altogether. 
- [ ] Need to introduce much more data input validation (i.e. valid link, valid email) whenever easy / possible
=== General non-technical ===
- [ ] Need to clarify the scope better, and remind users of difference between deployments and hardware
- [ ] Section descriptions are often skipped; can make them a lot shorter and/or ask if understood (mandatory) to proceed
- [ ] Not clear that all but the basic info sections are optional
- [ ] Incentives for filling in the questionnaire (i.e. card at the end, etc.)"
- [ ] Licencing
- [ ] Need to ask user's permission to licence data
