- [x] Maybe here is a good place to put last firmware update instead of Update frequency"?
=== Intended usage scope === 
- [x] Taxonomy: convert to checklist with vernacular / scientific names. 
- [x] Maybe add functional guild or other non-taxonomic grouping?
- [x] Habitats: convert to a Dropdown/Checklist of standardized habitat types.
- [x] Constraints: split ranges into Min and Max fields (e.g., Temp Min/Max °C).
- [x] Environment: clarify "Operational Environment" (Aquatic/Terrestrial) and add IP Rating for weatherproofing.
- [x] Target: add typical subject size range (Min/Max mm) as numeric fields.
- [ ] ~~"Operational costs": need to clarify, add something about running costs for one season~~ REMOVED, all costs are in device details now
=== Missing questions to add (maybe) ===
- [ ] Mounting Systems: how the device attaches to the environment (e.g. tripod, tree mount, pole, etc).
- [ ] Charging infrastructure: Number of batteries, solar panel wattage, charging cycles.
- [ ] Alternative components? How "flexible" are devices? 
- [ ] Institution Type: categorization of the organization (NGO, Academic, Government, Commercial).
- [ ] Pros/Cons: A qualitative field for users to list known limitations or advantages of the device.
- [ ] Data Analysis Platform: Where the data is processed (local machine, cloud platform name).


